editor Claude Code
model claude-opus-5
voice Kyri
host Vultr SEA NixOS VPS ai-jail pier (Daylight DC-1 hand) -- Eastern (EDT)
title Caravan repose -- the mark an operator opens says whether anybody still objects
prompt Kyri first, then REMEMBER and the road-ahead itineraries; Standfast on reds, then the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first; council rota one doc; condense REMEMBER when a set closes; send each finished increment
think Standfast first. The reds ledger reads six rows, every one CLOSED, and the e123 living-pin guard that consumes it ran GREEN before any new work opened -- so the line was clear and the constructive queue was the honest next move.
think The running thread came from the newest log's recommend, which named its own open question exactly: what a run owes an objection it let go. The record holds both readings and the escort still stands, which is honest and entirely silent about whether a word let go should keep escorting every operator who reads it afterward.
think Two answers were available. One withdraws the mark on its author's word; the other keeps the mark and tells the truth about it. The arc's own discipline chose for me -- lapse had just seated a term reports and never withdraws, and a rung that took escorts down would be spending the discipline it had earned one lap earlier.
think The sharpening came from asking where the finding actually lands. The term is published in plan.term, and an operator reads plan.beside; the answer was filed where the deciding happened rather than carried to where the reading happens. So the rung is delivery, not annotation, and the measurement is a finding filed rather than delivered.
think The shape followed from refusing a second file. A second note is a second thing to know about, and a reader who does not know it exists reads a live quarrel forever. One byte appended to the escort itself means the mark cannot be read without its standing -- and because the reading stays byte one, every elder reader of that file still reads exactly the mark it always read.
think Built by delegation rather than by copy, per the sameness lesson from the lap below. Every fold lapse owns became a one-line wrapper on lapse, the report grew one tier of nesting, and only this rung's own supervisor step stayed local.
think Four refusals named before the wire was written: the moment, the supply, the count, the record. Then the wire step reads its own mark back out of the note an operator would open, and checks the reading underneath is untouched, before the report believes a word of it.
obs The council rota doc this lap was item 11, single-stranded, taken as choir count 65 mod 27. Its lens decided the shape twice: the second-file design would have braided a reader's understanding across two notes they must both know about, and the delegating build kept every fold of the rung below free to be drawn out and read alone.
obs The planted control was the most instructive part of the lap. Disarming both guards that spare an unweighed objection, the refusal, the fabricated answer, the folds, and every harness read that catches them, the run published sq -- this objection is at repose -- over a reader who was never asked, with plan.term and desk.again both absent from the wire and the selftest still printing GREEN.
obs An honest intermediate finding: reaching ReposeEarly on the wire took disarming a contract assert first, because the mark-count invariant fires before the refusal can. The assert is doing its job; the refusal is the door behind it.
loom witness=caravan_repose_witness rungs_green=66 phases=6 dependents=6 marks_stood=1 unstanding_bare=1 unstanding_standing=0 red_paths=5
file caravan/repose.rye the rung -- the standing fold, its four refusals, the note that appends one byte to the mark, and the wire step that reads it back
file tools/caravan_repose_witness.rish the witness -- the two-run lap, the wire an operator reads, and the five RED paths named
file tools/caravan_suite_witness.rish registers the rung in the choir the same round, so the loom hears it (REDS %81's lesson)
file caravan/README.md the durable per-rung record, roster row and section, moved in the same commit as the code
file crux/REMEMBER.md the live edge seated, the lapse rung condensed to a pointer, the git nib pinned in the work commit
file .gitignore the new note directory held out of the tree
recommend keep-going the arc has answered for reach at every moment of a dependent's life, repaired what a fall cost, taken back its own stale judgments, written to the reader those judgments misled, carried the letter, read the answer, recorded the disagreement, stood the published word beside it, put a term on how long that objection may stand, and now carries that term into the mark an operator opens -- so the question above it is what a run owes the reader themselves: every finding of this arc travels to the place a word is read, and nothing has ever gone back to the person who raised the quarrel to tell them how it came out.
